<!-- Key Bindings → Journey Together Forever (U107): opens the book at the page Settings chose (the Chapter page by
     default) and closes it when it is open. Through /jtf, the one global the addon has for commands.
     category is the section on the game's Keybindings page, titled with _G[category] (BINDING_HEADER_..., set in
     Core/Slash.lua). No header attribute: that page draws a header as a blank spacer, so under AddOns the row said
     only "Open or close the book" (the owner, 10 Nov 2026: "no option to set a keybinding"). The name is what the
     players' keys are saved under: never rename it. Shift+J is given in code (Core/Slash.lua), only while it is free. -->
<Bindings>
  <Binding name="JOURNEYTOGETHERFOREVER_OPEN" category="BINDING_HEADER_JOURNEYTOGETHERFOREVER">
    SlashCmdList.JOURNEYTOGETHERFOREVER("key")
  </Binding>
</Bindings>
